      "dct:description": "Kaggle version 1 of the COUGHVID crowdsourced cough recordings dataset. The source describes over 25,000 recordings and a physician-labelled subset of 2,800 recordings. Includes recordings in WebM and Ogg containers, per-recording JSON metadata, and metadata_compiled.csv. The Kaggle source credits Orlandic, Teijeiro and Atienza, The COUGHVID crowdsourcing dataset (2021), DOI 10.1038/s41597-021-00937-4. Kaggle uploader: Larxel (andrewmvd).",
